github.com/Futzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-22T08:18:34Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T08:18:34Z","body":"I was able to test the format function, `\"{0}\".format([a])`, and found that this just always returns 0.0, even when the float is -0.0.\n\nIt seems like this could be an issue of its own, though it's possibly more subjective.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2900331610/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2901833775","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106710#issuecomment-2901833775","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106710","id":2901833775,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6s9ngv","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-22T16:18:13Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T16:18:13Z","body":"This might be an issue related to variable assignment rather than formatting/printing.  The gdscript below prints -0.0 twice:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar a: float = -0.0\n\tvar b: float = 0.0\n\t\n\tprint_float(b)\n\tprint_float(a)\n\nfunc print_float(f: float):\n\tprint(\"%.1f\" % f)\n```\n\nIn the above example, `b` is printed first, but `a`'s value is printed twice.  It looks like the gdscript compiler keeps a `HashMap` of constant values to reuse the same address if the same constant is used multiple times, through `GDScriptByteCodeGenerator::add_or_get_constant`.  I think 0.0 and -0.0 are seen as equal, so only one constant is used for both within the same function.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2901833775/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2902555779","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106710#issuecomment-2902555779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106710","id":2902555779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tAXyD","user":{"login":"Futzer","id":10804423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODA0NDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10804423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer","html_url":"https://github.com/Futzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Futzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-22T20:58:26Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T20:58:26Z","body":"It looks like hashing a float Variant calls `hash_murmur3_one_double` in hashfuncs.h, which has the following comment: `// Normalize +/- 0.0 and NaN values so they hash the same.`\n\nHowever, I believe this is still an issue because 0.0 and -0.0 are different constants and lead to different outcomes when used. For example, the following computations diverge:\n```\nfunc _ready():\n\ttest1()\n\ttest2()\n\nfunc test1():\n\tvar unrelated: float = 0.0\n\tvar a: float = 0.0\n\tvar b: float = 0.0\n\tprint(\"atan2 of %.1f and %.1f: %.3f\" % [a, b, atan2(a, b)]) # 0\n\nfunc test2():\n\tvar unrelated: float = -0.0\n\tvar a: float = 0.0\n\tvar b: float = 0.0\n\tprint(\"atan2 of %.1f and %.1f: %.3f\" % [a, b, atan2(a, b)]) # -PI\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2902555779/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2903245331","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106710#issuecomment-2903245331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106710","id":2903245331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tDAIT","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-23T04:42:14Z","updated_at":"2025-05-23T04:42:14Z","body":"* Duplicate of #56306.\n* See also #56338.\n* Thanks for reporting the bug nonetheless!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2903245331/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]